{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S05（仅18秒）等段仍有大量未标记为定时出现的感受词，细节容易来不及消化，Y的短词排列反而更轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的关键词加亮让观众能迅速抓住每段叙事的核心转折，不必读完所有文字也能跟上人物心理。更重要的是，X的感受不只是给情绪贴标签，而是把音色、节奏、身体反应和心理变化联系起来，并通过定时出现让这些细节与音乐进程相互印证。Y的左右分栏更轻巧，完整叙述也比较顺读，但整体感受的具体程度、音乐对应的细腻度以及贯穿全曲的情绪呼应，X更有优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c90172ea-ff32-4a96-ab7b-66d1f0621a7b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T172700196957Z", "elapsed_seconds": 114.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T17:28:55.105715+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "03af2a859674c18c53714fa0085c3d6ec52499961697c2890a5137c1e0fbc58a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme